% The relation of the demand for an adornment, magic$path$bf here, holds
% the bindings path is asked about, and a limit that refuses it names path/2,
% the predicate whose demand it records.
edge(a, b). edge(b, c). edge(c, d). edge(d, e).
path(X, Y) :- edge(X, Y).
path(X, Z) :- edge(X, Y), path(Y, Z).
path(a, X)?
